        "content": "<p>smarcd opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14979\">PR #14979</a> from <code>smarcd:global-get-numeric</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Reading a numeric global never has to clone a GC reference, so it does not need <code>AsContextMut</code>. This adds <code>Global::get_numeric(&amp;self, impl AsContext) -&gt; Option&lt;Val&gt;</code>, returning <code>None</code> for reference-typed globals, so embedders can read numeric globals from the epoch and call hooks that only get <code>StoreHookState</code> after #14386.</p>\n<p><code>Global::get</code> now reuses the same numeric read, so there is no duplicated implementation. Tables are left alone for now.</p>\n<p>Closes #14965</p>\n</blockquote>",
